# Training scratch space (see training/README.md) -- downloaded models,
# generated labels, checkpoints, and exported ONNX artifacts are not source
# and are not committed. The trained .onnx this eventually produces gets
# added deliberately, in its own commit, once it exists.
training/models/
training/*.jsonl
training/*.pt
training/*.onnx
